temperatur. Danach gibt sie zwischen 2 und 8 Stunden Wärme ab: rund 3 Stunden, wenn du sie in den Händen hältst, bis zu 6 Stunden unter der Bettdecke. Zum Vergleich – eine klassische Wärmflasche ist nach etwa einer halben Stunde nur noch lauwarm.<\/p>","kokoro_color_on":false,"kokoro_text_color":"#1a1a1a","kokoro_shadow_on":false,"kokoro_shadow_strength":45,"kokoro_font_size_desktop":"","kokoro_font_size_mobile":"","kokoro_gradient_on":false,"kokoro_gradient_start":"#a9beb6","kokoro_gradient_end":"#5e887e","kokoro_gradient_direction":"to right","enable_text_truncation":false,"truncate_lines":3,"truncate_view_more_label":"View more","truncate_view_less_label":"View less","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","custom_typography_font":"work_sans_n4","enable_bold_typography_font":false,"bold_typography_font":"work_sans_n7","enable_italic_typography_font":false,"italic_typography_font":"work_sans_i4","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color_mode":"default","color":"var(--color-foreground)","custom_color_style":"solid","custom_text_color":"#000000","custom_gradient_color_start":"#000000","custom_gradient_color_end":"#666666","custom_gradient_direction":"to right","custom_color_bold":"#000000","custom_color_italic":"#000000","custom_color_underline":"#000000","custom_color_background_bold":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","custom_color_background_italic":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","custom_color_background_underline":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0,"ancher_id":""},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["t"]},"r2":{"type":"_accordion-row","settings":{"heading":"Muss sie beim Benutzen am Strom hängen?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"t":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Nein. Das Kabel brauchst du nur zum Aufheizen – rund 80 cm lang, danach ziehst du es ab und die Wärmflasche ist frei. Wichtig: Während des Aufheizens darf sie nicht benutzt werden und soll flach liegen.<\/p>","kokoro_color_on":false,"kokoro_text_color":"#1a1a1a","kokoro_shadow_on":false,"kokoro_shadow_strength":45,"kokoro_font_size_desktop":"","kokoro_font_size_mobile":"","kokoro_gradient_on":false,"kokoro_gradient_start":"#a9beb6","kokoro_gradient_end":"#5e887e","kokoro_gradient_direction":"to right","enable_text_truncation":false,"truncate_lines":3,"truncate_view_more_label":"View more","truncate_view_less_label":"View less","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","custom_typography_font":"work_sans_n4","enable_bold_typography_font":false,"bold_typography_font":"work_sans_n7","enable_italic_typography_font":false,"italic_typography_font":"work_sans_i4","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color_mode":"default","color":"var(--color-foreground)","custom_color_style":"solid","custom_text_color":"#000000","custom_gradient_color_start":"#000000","custom_gradient_color_end":"#666666","custom_gradient_direction":"to right","custom_color_bold":"#000000","custom_color_italic":"#000000","custom_color_underline":"#000000","custom_color_background_bold":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","custom_color_background_italic":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","custom_color_background_underline":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0,"ancher_id":""},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["t"]},"r4":{"type":"_accordion-row","settings":{"heading":"Sie wird nicht warm – was jetzt?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"t":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Prüf zuerst zwei Dinge: Steckt der Stecker richtig in der Dose, und ist der Ladeanschluss an der Wärmflasche bis zum Einrasten verbunden? Ist die Wärmflasche noch warm von der letzten Nutzung, lässt sie sich erst wieder aufheizen, wenn sie abgekühlt ist.<\/p><p>Funktioniert das Kabel und die Wärmflasche bleibt trotzdem kalt, schreib uns – dann schauen wir uns das gemeinsam an. Einzelne Teile bekommst du bei uns auch als Ersatz, du musst nicht das ganze Set neu kaufen.<\/p>","kokoro_color_on":false,"kokoro_text_color":"#1a1a1a","kokoro_shadow_on":false,"kokoro_shadow_strength":45,"kokoro_font_size_desktop":"","kokoro_font_size_mobile":"","kokoro_gradient_on":false,"kokoro_gradient_start":"#a9beb6","kokoro_gradient_end":"#5e887e","kokoro_gradient_direction":"to right","enable_text_truncation":false,"truncate_lines":3,"truncate_view_more_label":"View more","truncate_view_less_label":"View less","width":"100%","max_width":"normal","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","custom_typography_font":"work_sans_n4","enable_bold_typography_font":false,"bold_typography_font":"work_sans_n7","enable_italic_typography_font":false,"italic_typography_font":"work_sans_i4","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color_mode":"default","color":"var(--color-foreground)","custom_color_style":"solid","custom_text_color":"#000000","custom_gradient_color_start":"#000000","custom_gradient_color_end":"#666666","custom_gradient_direction":"to right","custom_color_bold":"#000000","custom_color_italic":"#000000","custom_color_underline":"#000000","custom_color_background_bold":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","custom_color_background_italic":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","custom_color_background_underline":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0,"ancher_id":""},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["t"]}},"block_order":["r1","r2","r4"]},"cat3":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>PFLEGE &amp; AUFBEWAHRUNG<\/p>","kokoro_color_on